  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Autoclave distilled water. After autoclaving, allow to cool, aseptically add 10 x Korthof's basal medium and heat-inactivated rabbit serum that has been filter--sterilized ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except CaCl2 and autoclave. Dissolve CaCl2 in 50 ml distilled water and filter--sterilize. After autoclaving, allow to cool, add sterile CaCl2 solution to the medium."
    }
  ]
}